    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You served a vampire, or a small group of vampires sharing a lair. The undead drank your blood more times than you can count. You might have served willingly, perhaps hoping to become a vampire yourself someday, or you were magically charmed and remember only fragments of your time as a vampire's familiar. Either way, your days in the vampire's den are behind you.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Constitution, Charisma</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.7dhJllD0NmSTJ8H8]{Vampire's Plaything}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Persuasion and Stealth</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulCooksUtens]{Cook's Utensils}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulCooksUtens]{Cook's Utensils}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagClothesFine]{Fine Clothes}, 2 @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBottleGlass]{Glass Bottles}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagHealersKit0]{Healer's Kit}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagPerfume0000]{Perfume}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagLamp0000000]{Lamp}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagOil00000000]{Oil} (3 flasks), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagWaterskin00]{Waterskin}, 19 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
